PATTERNS
PronounAbs ([<nom>:] | [<erg>:] | (LocMarker DirMarker)) [<emph>:да]?
PronounObl ((([<m><sg>:в] | [<f><sg>:й] | [<n><sg>:б] | [<an><pl>:б] | [<inan><pl>:р]) [<gen>:]) | CaseMarker[-erg,-gen]) (LocMarker DirMarker)? [<emph>:да]?
PronounObl LocMarker DirMarker [<emph>:да]?

(([он:жи] ClassMarker) | [он<an><pl>:жал]) [<nom>:] [<emph>:да]?
[он:ин] ([<m><sg><erg>:що] | (([<f>:] | [<n>:]) [<sg><erg>:лълъе]) | (([<in>:] | [<inan>:]) [<pl><erg>:до])) (LocMarker DirMarker)? [<emph>:да]?
[он:ин] (OblMarker[m] | (([<an>:] | [<inan>:]) [<pl>:ду])) [<gen>:] [:б]? (LocMarker DirMarker)? [<emph>:да]?
[он:ин] (OblMarker[f] | OblMarker[n]) CaseMarker[gen] (LocMarker DirMarker)? [<emph>:да]?
[он:ин] OblMarker [<dat><emph>:тта]
[он:ин] OblMarker CaseMarker[dat] LocMarker DirMarker [<emph>:да]
[он:ин] OblMarker CaseMarker[aff] (LocMarker DirMarker)? [<emph>:да]?
[он:ин] OblMarker LocMarker DirMarker [<emph>:да]?

((DemPronoun[com] ClassMarker) | (DemPronoun[m] ClassMarker[m]) | (DemPronoun[f] ClassMarker[f]) | (DemPronoun[n] ClassMarker[n]) | (DemPronoun[pl] (ClassMarker[pl] | [<an><pl>:б] | [<inan><pl>:р]))) [<nom>:]
DemPronoun[com] (([<m>:щ] | [<f>:т] | [<n>:т]) [<sg><erg>:ти]) | ((OblMarker[hpl] | OblMarker[npl]) [<erg>:ди]) (LocMarker DirMarker)?
DemPronoun[com] (OblMarker[m] | OblMarker[hpl]) [<gen>:] [:б]? (LocMarker DirMarker)?
DemPronoun[com] (OblMarker[f] | OblMarker[n] | OblMarker[npl]) CaseMarker[gen] (LocMarker DirMarker)?
DemPronoun[com] OblMarker CaseMarker[-erg,-gen] (LocMarker DirMarker)?
DemPronoun[m] ([<m><sg><erg>:щти] | (OblMarker[m] (([<gen>:] [:б]?) | CaseMarker[-erg,-gen]))) (LocMarker DirMarker)?
DemPronoun[f] ([<f><sg><erg>:тти] | (OblMarker[f] CaseMarker[-erg])) (LocMarker DirMarker)?
DemPronoun[n] ([<n><sg><erg>:тти] | (OblMarker[n] CaseMarker[-erg])) (LocMarker DirMarker)?
DemPronoun[pl] OblMarker[hpl] (([<gen>:] [:б]?) | CaseMarker[-gen]) (LocMarker DirMarker)?
DemPronoun[pl] OblMarker[npl] CaseMarker (LocMarker DirMarker)?
((DemPronoun[com] OblMarker) | (DemPronoun[m] OblMarker[m]) | (DemPronoun[f] OblMarker[f]) | (DemPronoun[n] OblMarker[n]) | (DemPronoun[pl] OblMarker[pl])) LocMarker DirMarker

LEXICON PronounAbs
я:ден
ты:мин
мы<incl>:ище
мы<excl>:илIе
вы:битте

LEXICON PronounObl
я:ди
ты:ду
мы<incl>:ищи
мы<excl>:илIи
вы:битти

LEXICON DemPronoun
этот<speak>:гьа[com]
этот<list>:гьу[com]
тот<speak>:гьадо[m]
тот<speak>:гьаде[f]
тот<speak>:гьада[n]
тот<speak>:гьада[pl]
тот<list>:гьудо[m]
тот<list>:гьуде[f]
тот<list>:гьуда[n]
тот<list>:гьуда[pl]
<infer>:гье[com]
<anaph>:гьо[com]

LEXICON ClassMarker
<m><sg>:в[m]
<f><sg>:й[f]
<n><sg>:б[n]
<an><pl>:бе[pl]
<inan><pl>:ре[pl]

LEXICON OblMarker
<m><sg>:щу[m]
<f><sg>:лълъи[f]
<n><sg>:лълъи[n]
<an><pl>:рду[hpl]
<inan><pl>:рди[npl]

LEXICON LocMarker
<cont>:чIу[cont]
<apud>:ха
<ad>:хъи

LEXICON DirMarker
<ess>:
<lat>:
<elat>:ру
<allat>:ху[al]
<translat>:руху[trans]
<translat>:риди[trans]
<translat>:руди[trans]
<translat>:рикьи[trans]

LEXICON CaseMarker
<erg>:ди[erg]
<gen>:лIи[gen]
<dat>:лъи[dat]
<aff>:ра[aff]
